# A phone held sideways (844 x 390 at 3x): the title, the mode select and setup by touch, a Practice
# deal on the glasshouse with the rails' drawer (ℹ), a draw from the tray, a hint, then the pause
# screen and its Settings, back to the deal.
# viewport 844x390@3
until 600 Patience
frames 10
save land-title
touch =Play
until 120 Choose your table
frames 10
touch =Practice
until 120 Begin
frames 10
touch =Begin
until 300 Hint
frames 60
save land-game
touch =Toggle objective panel
until 60 OBJECTIVE
frames 10
expect GARDEN
save land-drawer
touch =Toggle objective panel
frames 10
touch ⟳ Draw
frames 30
expect ↦ 1
touch ✦ Hint
frames 20
expect Hint:
touch =Pause (Esc)
until 60 Paused
frames 10
touch =Settings
until 120 Interface
frames 10
save land-settings
touch =Done
until 60 Paused
frames 10
touch =Resume
frames 20
expect Practice
